    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME MADE FOR ALL AGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigeon's Mission is a satire in the form of a simulator. In this game, you are a pigeon in the middle of the city and you must complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a friend in a 2-player duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can fly freely through the city between buildings and streets, trying to hit everything you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ARROW keys on your keyboard control the character's flight. The left SHIFT key makes you fly higher. The left CTRL key makes the character descend. The SPACE key shoots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several improvements and supply boxes are located in places on the map for you to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking up supply boxes improves your scoring ability and your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boxes increase your ammunition. Other boxes improve your accuracy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2-PLAYER ONLINE PvP MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you play with a friend to see who is the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player starts the match in a new game. The second player needs to connect to player 1 using IP adress of player 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around the city hitting everything you can to score points before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winner gets a special prize at the end of the round.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME MADE FOR ALL AGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigeon's Mission is a satire in the form of a simulator. In this game, you are a pigeon in the middle of the city and you must complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a friend in a 2-player duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can fly freely through the city between buildings and streets, trying to hit everything you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ARROW keys on your keyboard control the character's flight. The left SHIFT key makes you fly higher. The left CTRL key makes the character descend. The SPACE key shoots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several improvements and supply boxes are located in places on the map for you to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking up supply boxes improves your scoring ability and your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boxes increase your ammunition. Other boxes improve your accuracy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2-PLAYER ONLINE PvP MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you play with a friend to see who is the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player starts the match in a new game. The second player needs to connect to player 1 using IP adress of player 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around the city hitting everything you can to score points before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winner gets a special prize at the end of the round.</p>",
    "short_description": "Pigeon's Mission is a satire in the form of a simulator and it's a game made for people of all ages. In this game, you are a pigeon in the middle of the city and you need to complete your mission. You can score points alone or challenge a friend to prove who is the best.",
